    <item>
      <title>🎙️ Luciano Spalletti’s #JuveVenezia press conference: • Kalulu and Nico Gonzále…</title>
      <link>https://t.me/juventus/18084</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/juventus/18084</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 16:47:20 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>🎙️ Luciano Spalletti’s #JuveVenezia press conference: • Kalulu and Nico González will not be available. • Conceição will be assessed. Sooner or later, he’ll be back on the pitch. • Woltemade feels comfortable playing in his new role. I’m convinced he’ll succeed. • Ekhator is an important prospect. I hope he continues improving his physical condition. • I really don’t understand why there’s so much fuss about Zidane and Conte’s comments. • I’m preparing for this 600th match with exactly the same excitement I felt before my first. • Spoke to McKennie after his interview, I didn’t get the impression that he wanted to leave. • Gatti is trying to add something more to his game beyond simply defending. • We’ll face a side that plays very vertically. As soon as they regain possession, they immediately look to attack the space behind the opposition.</description>
